  "notes": "Official 2025-2026 Political Science (AA-T) Online transfer pathway to CSUB, Cal-GETC pattern. Per-semester printed totals 16 / 13-14 / 16 / 15; row sums reconcile exactly (16+13+16+15=60). Political science can be obtained completely online. CSUB Political Science requires a C or higher in STAT C1000. POLS C102, POLS C103 are only offered online during spring semesters. Only semesters 1-4 (the Cerro Coso degree portion) are sequenced; semesters 5-8 of the pathway document are CSUB upper-division coursework and are excluded from the seed. Credit ranges use the source's lower bound (documented). No course-level prerequisites are printed on the pathway.",
